{
  "$comment": [
    "Ground truth for the configuration keys deploy/azure/infra/main.bicep is allowed to emit.",
    "Each entry names the type and property that binds the key so a rename in the",
    "application breaks this contract instead of silently producing a container that",
    "ignores its own configuration.",
    "Entries carrying pendingOwner are contributed by a sibling task that has not landed on this branch: the test asserts they are still absent so the marker cannot rot.",
    "Security:Proxy:KnownProxies, Security:Proxy:KnownNetworks, and Security:Proxy:ForwardLimit are intentionally absent: Container Apps publishes no address range for the internal ingress hop, so the deployment trusts no forwarded address and the client IP is not observable."
  ],
